---
description: Cross-tool session continuity protocol (shared with Claude Code and Codex)
alwaysApply: true
---

This repo shares memory across Claude Code, Codex and Cursor through files in `.ai/`. Follow the "Session protocol" in `AGENTS.md`.

- First action in a new chat: run `python3 .ai/bin/context.py --pull` in the terminal (Windows: `py -3` instead of `python3`) and continue from the state file's "Next steps".
- On handoff/stop/switch: follow `.agents/skills/handoff/SKILL.md` (or `/handoff`), using tool name `cursor`.
- MCP servers: edit `.ai/mcp.json`, then run `python3 .ai/bin/sync.py`. Never hand-edit `.cursor/mcp.json`.
